{"reviews":[{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-0","r":5.0,"t":"Works great!","x":"I really appreciated the large amount of strips and wipes the product came with! I used this on my underarms and I haven't gotten any sort of irritation after using both the strips and the wipes. I'd definitely recommend.","h":69,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-1","r":5.0,"t":"Love this product!","x":"So easy, convenient, mess free and best of all it worked great! Used on myself and adult daughter for bikini area and was very pleased with the results! Wasn\u2019t sure if it would stick well but it made a clean sweep with cutting a couple pre waxed strips in half","h":50,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-2","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to use, no mess","x":"This was by far the easiest and cleanest waxing product I\u2019ve tried. Quick and convenient.","h":48,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-3","r":5.0,"t":"Said goodbye to chin hair!","x":"As a woman in her 30s, I get the occasional chin hair (or 5) so I bought these wax strips to help. The strips are very large so I just cut a small piece to use. At the rate I\u2019m using them, one pack should last at least a year! Very easy to use- just warm up in your hands, apply to area and rub in direction of hair growth, hold skin taut and pull off quickly in opposite direction. Boom! No more chin hair. Soak a cotton ball in olive oil to take off the stickiness and you\u2019re all good. Highly recom","h":47,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-4","r":5.0,"t":"sensitive skin","x":"Loved this, acutely worked better than I thought and easy clean up!","h":47,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-5","r":5.0,"t":"Works Great!","x":"Easy to use and convenient.  Instructions are easy to follow and item includes wipes which are perfect.","h":44,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-6","r":5.0,"t":"Neck hair removal success","x":"I was hesitant to buy this product for hair removal for the nap of my neck. I typically use a razor but often end up with razor burn. This product did the job with ease","h":42,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-7","r":5.0,"t":"First at-home wax to actually work","x":"I bought this in a scramble when we were suddenly invited to visit a friend with a pool and my usual aesthetician had just closed shop.. I hate to shave my bikini area -- ingrown hairs always result -- so I tried this as a last resort. To my surprise and pleasure, the wax works great! Just as good as having a pro do it. And no mess -- you just warm the strip in your hand, place the strip on the area to wax, and pull. I felt no pain (I've been told I have a high pain tolerance, but usually I do a","h":36,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-8","r":5.0,"t":"Great product","x":"These work very well and are easy to cut for any size area without gumming up the scissors.","h":35,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-9","r":5.0,"t":"smooth","x":"works great I used this product on my armpits and was super cautious because the last wax strip I used on my armpit left red bumps and I was super sore for at least 3 days. These strips left me feeling smooth with no crazy side affects.","h":28,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-10","r":5.0,"t":"So easy and they work!","x":"Finally used these on my 12yo daughter the other day, and they worked so well! No rash, easy to use, didn't leave a ton of wax. Really make this so much easier, thank you!","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-11","r":5.0,"t":"Works great!","x":"Loved the way they left my skin feeling!","h":25,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-12","r":5.0,"t":"Works great!","x":"Loved the way they left my skin feeling!","h":25,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-13","r":5.0,"t":"Skip the salon","x":"I was skeptical about cancelling my salon appointment and trying these strips.  However, pleasantly surprised when they worked wonderfully on my underarms and legs. You can also use them about 3 times before giving up on the strip.  I will be keeping stock in these monthly and skipping my leg and underarm wax appointments going far.  Don't think, just purchase.","h":24,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-14","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome Sensitive Skin product","x":"I love this! Not too painful! This product was awesome! Made for sensitive skin.","h":21,"v":1,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great wax strips","x":"Great Wax strips!  Easy to use and Removed 100% of the hair!","h":21,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-16","r":5.0,"t":"Simple & effective on my sensitive skin","x":"So I bought these strips since I liked their hair removing lotion, but I wanted something quicker and easy to dispose of for less sensitive areas. This product does the job and its easy to use! I haven't used it on my bikini areas since I like to use the lotion for that, but my skin is smooth and hair-free :) I strongly suggest prepping first before any hair removal, shower + lotion after getting the hair off. I like to keep my lotion in the fridge and use it cold so the pores will shrink and it","h":18,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-17","r":5.0,"t":"Thumbs \ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffd","x":"Make sure the straps are warm because it won't work as well as they should.... I put a couple of strip in a zip lock bag and gave them a warm bath before using.","h":16,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-18","r":5.0,"t":"Do not use on bikini area","x":"Please save yourself from a terrible mess & do not use these for bikini area. Has an uneven pull & you have to over the same spot 3x to get all the hair. Also leaves a sticky mess that the wipes do not take off.  UPDATE: talked with customer service who offered me a refund and apologized for my dissatisfaction. I still feel these wouldn\u2019t work for the bikini area but I do know they work well on the face.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-19","r":5.0,"t":"Worked great!","x":"Used these for my legs, was able to use each side of the strip 6 times before needing a new one, much better than any other brand I've tried!","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-20","r":5.0,"t":"The quality of the strips was remarkable","x":"Quality which stands out in this day and age where quality is comprismised The strips had no odor.  This is useful for sensitivities also the stickiness was superb as they worked so well on the skin to remove most hairs.  Can use both sides after peeling. A great professional company to work with.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-21","r":5.0,"t":"Great quality and easy to use","x":"So far the best wax stripes, work very well and don\u2019t irritate the skin. Fast delivery as well. Would recommend to try and planning to order more for myself.","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-22","r":5.0,"t":"Works great for me.","x":"This product was very effective. It was so quick and smells nice too. I was surprised by how amazingly effective this product is. Thanks so much for an amazing hair removal wax kit.","h":7,"v":0,"d":"May 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-23","r":5.0,"t":"Removes hair well","x":"Great product.  Good for removing unwanted hair in many places, but I used it for the patches on my back.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B08NF1BTHM-24","r":5.0,"t":"Goodbye European Wax...Hello Avashine Wax Strips","x":"This is an amazingly easy product to use.  I have tried many kinds of was strips as I am used to going to European Wax in California.  I now live in Oregon and that company is not in this state.  I use my blow dryer to heat up the strip (only a coupe of seconds) and it works like the salon without leaving my house.  LOVE IT!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the product as easy to use and convenient.","cites":[2,3,4,6,9,11]},{"text":"Many reviewers report the strips work well and deliver good results.","cites":[1,2,5,7,8,9,10,11,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers note the product is gentle on sensitive skin, causing little to no irritation or rash.","cites":[1,5,10,11,15]},{"text":"Reviewers appreciate the included wipes and the generous quantity of strips, with some noting the large strips can be cut to size and last a long time.","cites":[1,4,6,9,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers highlight that the product is clean and mess-free to use.","cites":[2,3,5,11]}]},"qa":[]}